<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="mn">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Reference — FORAE ARCHITECTS</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #ffffff; --ink: #161616; --graphite: #7a7a75; --hairline: #e6e5e0;
    --sans: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { 
    background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100vh;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  main { flex: 1 0 auto; max-width: 800px; padding: 64px 32px 0; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  
  /* Header */
  .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px 32px; gap: 24px; }
  .logo { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: lowercase; }
  nav.primary { display: flex; gap: 32px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; font-weight: 400; text-transform: lowercase; }
  nav.primary a:hover { color: var(--graphite); }
  nav.primary a.active { color: var(--graphite); font-weight: 600; }

  /* Content */
  .section-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--graphite); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .text-content { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink); max-width: 640px; }
  .text-content p { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .ref-list { list-style: none; margin-top: 24px; }
  .ref-list li { margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding-bottom: 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; }
  .ref-list span { color: var(--graphite); display: inline-block; width: 60px; }

  /* Footer */
  footer { margin-top: auto; padding: 24px 32px 32px; text-align: center; }
  .copyright { font-size: 12px; color: var(--graphite); }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .header-inner { padding: 14px 18px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
    nav.primary { gap: 16px; }
    main { padding: 32px 18px 0; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a class="logo" href="/">forae architects</a>
    <nav class="primary">
      <a href="/practice">practice</a>
      <a href="/contact">contact</a>
      <a href="/news">news</a>
      <a href="/reference" class="active">reference</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="section-title">References & Recognition</div>
  <div class="text-content">
    <p>Энэхүү хэсэгт студийн судалгааны ажил, уран бүтээлийн тэмдэглэл, онолын эх сурвалжууд байрлах энгийн орон зай юм.</p>
    <ul class="ref-list">
      <li><span>2025</span> Архитектурын шилдэг бүтээл номинаци — "Модон Оффис Цамхаг"</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <p class="copyright">© 2026 forae architects</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
